msgid ""
"The element editor window is a PopUp window from QElectroTech. It has also "
"been designed using `Qt`_ framework and widget toolkit. The window from "
"QElectroTech element editor is the same for all platforms where it is "
"available (Windows, Linux/Unix and MacOS). The window from the element "
"editor contains the following areas:"
msgstr ""
"元件编辑器窗口是 QElectroTech 的一个弹出窗口，同样使用 `Qt <Qt_>`_ 框架和控件工具包设计。QElectroTech "
"元件编辑器窗口在所有可用平台（Windows、Linux/Unix 和 MacOS）上都相同。元件编辑器窗口包含以下区域："

